flowchart TD
    User[Player input] --> UI[Streamlit user interface]
    UI --> Game[Number-guessing game logic]
    Game --> State[Game state and guess history]
    State --> UI
    State --> Analysis[Deterministic range and attempt analysis]
    UI --> Choice{AI feature requested?}

    Choice -->|Strategy Coach| RAG[RAG Strategy Coach]
    State --> RAG
    RAG --> Retrieval[Keyword retrieval logic]
    Retrieval --> KB[JSON strategy knowledge base]
    KB --> Retrieval
    Retrieval --> CoachPrompt[Public facts and retrieved advice]
    Analysis --> CoachPrompt
    CoachPrompt --> Ollama[Local Ollama llama3.2:3b]
    Ollama --> RAGValidation[Coach response validation]
    RAGValidation -->|Valid| Output[Results shown in Streamlit]
    RAGValidation -->|Invalid or request failure| Fallback[Deterministic fallback]
    Fallback --> Output

    Choice -->|Strategy Agent| Agent[AI Strategy Agent]
    State --> Agent
    Analysis --> Agent
    Agent --> AgentPrompt[Tool-selection prompt]
    AgentPrompt --> Ollama
    Ollama --> Selection[Dynamic tool selection]
    Selection --> Guardrails[Tool-plan validation]
    Guardrails -->|Allowed tool| Tools[Fixed Python tool execution]
    Guardrails -->|Invalid plan or request failure| AgentFallback[Deterministic fallback]
    Tools --> Range[analyze_range]
    Tools --> History[review_guess_history]
    Tools --> Attempts[evaluate_attempts]
    Tools --> Strategy[retrieve_strategy]
    Tools --> Guess[recommend_next_guess]
    Strategy --> Retrieval
    Range --> ResultsBundle[Tool results]
    History --> ResultsBundle
    Attempts --> ResultsBundle
    Guess --> ResultsBundle
    ResultsBundle --> Trace[Decision trace]
    ResultsBundle --> FinalPrompt[Tool results added to final explanation prompt]
    FinalPrompt --> Ollama
    Ollama --> FinalCheck[Final explanation validation]
    Analysis --> FinalCheck
    FinalCheck -->|Valid| Output
    FinalCheck -->|Invalid or timeout| AgentFallback
    AgentFallback --> Output
    Trace --> Output
    Output --> UI
